OL,7,FRussell Brand has been found guilty of
OL,8,Fone count of rape and three counts of
OL,9,Fsexual assault
OL,11,FThe judge tells him "obviously a
OL,12,Fcustodial sentence of some length will
OL,13,Fresult"
OL,15,FBrand, 51, faced seven counts: three of
OL,16,Frape, three of sexual assault and one
OL,17,Fof attempted indecent assault
OL,19,FThe allegations date from 1999 to 2009
OL,20,Fand concerned six women. They are all
OL,21,Fentitled to lifelong anonymity
